#MOBILES
#26710
cinder stalker~
A Cinder Stalker~
A Cinder Stalker prowls the scorched ground here.~
This creature's obsidian hide is cracked and faintly lit from within by the
heat of the earth.  Its four-limbed gait ripples the ash underfoot, and
hollow red eyes track your every movement.  It has stalked this wasteland
for ages, feeding on whatever wanders in from the lava forest beyond.
~
human~
