#26711
soot gargoyle~
A Soot Gargoyle~
A Soot Gargoyle crouches motionlessly in the volcanic haze.~
Dusted with thick black soot and perfectly still, the gargoyle resembles
a rough statue until it suddenly lunges.  Its obsidian-edged claws rake the
air as it attacks, and its wingbeats shower the ground with choking ash.
~
