#26712
magma troll~
A Magma Troll~
A Magma Troll stomps through smoldering debris here.~
This enormous humanoid's cracked hide pulses with veins of molten rock.
Whatever damage you deal it seems to reform before your eyes as cooling lava
is re-melted from within.  It regards your presence with absolute fury.
~
