#26713
ember drake~
An Ember Drake~
An Ember Drake crouches in the smoldering ruins here.~
This winged serpent's scales shift between cherry-red and dull black as its
body temperature fluctuates.  Smaller than a true dragon, its speed and
savagery more than compensate.  Wisps of smoke curl from its nostrils with
each shallow breath.
~
