#26714
slag demon~
A Slag Demon~
A Slag Demon rises from the molten ground here!~
This massive demonic entity erupts from the earth itself, composed of
superheated slag and volcanic rock.  The heat it radiates is staggering, and
the stone smokes where it treads.  An ancient and terrible hatred burns from
its hollow eyes.
~
