#26715
scorched giant~
A Scorched Giant~
A Scorched Giant strides through the ruins here.~
Once perhaps a hill giant, this towering figure has been transformed by
centuries of volcanic exposure.  Its skin is the color of charcoal and its
eyes smolder with angry light.  What passes for thought in its thick skull
is directed entirely toward violence.
~
