infernal sentinel~
An Infernal Sentinel~
An Infernal Sentinel stands in unwavering watch here.~
This armored hellspawn radiates heat from the red-glowing joints of its
black iron plate.  It was placed here by a power long since forgotten and
has faithfully guarded this wasteland ever since.  Its blade drips with
what looks disturbingly like liquid fire.
~
