ash wraith~
An Ash Wraith~
An Ash Wraith materializes from the settling ash here.~
The form of this undead entity is barely visible in the swirling volcanic
ash it commands.  Its touch brings the numbing cold of an unnatural death,
incongruous in this superheated place.  The wraith seems drawn to suffering.
~
