#26719
ashen herald~
The Ashen Herald~
The Ashen Herald surveys its domain from the center of the chamber.~
The Herald is a being of pure volcanic will, shaped like a humanoid over
eight feet tall, with skin like cooled obsidian and eyes that burn white
with inner fire.  It was the first being to call these wastes home, and
will be the last.  It speaks no words but promises only death.
~
