#26700
Gateway to the Ashen Wastes~
   You stand where the lava forest meets something far grimmer.  The olivine
sand underfoot gives way to cracked obsidian earth, and the smell of sulfur
grows stronger with each step north.  The distant horizon shimmers through
heat distortion, dark shapes moving slowly among the ruins visible ahead.
~
