#26701
The Scorched Path~
   A wide path of fractured basalt cuts through a sea of grey ash.  The heat
here is palpable, and the horizon shimmers in every direction.  The air is
thick with the fine grit of volcanic dust.  Dark shapes prowl the ground
ahead and to the east.
~
