The Cinder Flats~
   A flat expanse of black cinder, still radiating heat from below.  The
surface is treacherous, with thin crusts concealing pockets of superheated
air.  Ruins of stone walls jut from the cinder in irregular lines, their
original purpose long forgotten.
~
