#26704
The Smoldering Ravine~
   You follow the main path into a shallow ravine where the rock walls have
been cracked and stained orange and red by centuries of volcanic seepage.
Shallow channels of cooled lava mark the floor.  The heat here is
suffocating, and the deeper ruins ahead glow with a reddish, hellish light.
~
