#26705
The Fissure Ridge~
   A jagged ridge of fractured obsidian overlooking the wastes below.  Fumes
rise from deep cracks in the rock, and occasional geysers of superheated
steam vent without warning.  The ridge is strewn with the bones of things
that came here and did not leave.
~
