#26706
The Infernal Approach~
   The ruins grow dense here, the walls of some ancient structure converging
to form a rough corridor leading deeper underground.  The ambient light has
a reddish, hellish quality, and the stone walls are covered in markings that
might be ancient script or might just be ancient burns.  The temperature
climbs sharply.
~
