#26707
The Ashen Gallery~
   A long chamber whose ceiling has partially collapsed, admitting shafts of
lurid orange light from above.  The floor is carpeted with ash several inches
deep.  Demonic imagery has been carved into every surface, worn smooth by
ages of heat and pressure.  Shapes move restlessly in the deeper shadows
ahead.
~
