#26708
The Inner Sanctum~
   A vast circular chamber whose domed ceiling glows cherry-red from the
heat channeled up from below.  The floor is cracked obsidian mosaic, and
channels in the stone carry trickling streams of molten rock.  Breathing
here requires conscious effort.  Sounds from the chamber beyond suggest
something formidable awaits.
~
