#26709
The Herald's Chamber~
   The innermost room of the ruin.  The walls are polished obsidian,
reflecting a thousand distorted images.  A circular dais of volcanic glass
occupies the center, and the heat is extreme.  This is the heart of the
Ashen Wastes, and by all appearances it belongs to something ancient and
very much awake.
~
